# The hill's 59 m bend at 16 m/s on a keyboard: tapping left a third of the time (9 of every 30
# ticks) settles in a second to a steady part lean (0.45-0.64) and rides the bend 2 m outside the
# centreline, not into a curb. At bombing speed the lean follows the keys as a lag
# (board.leanAtSpeed); with the snappy park rates the same taps average 0.07 lean and run wide into
# the outer curb, and holding the key carves past the grip (45 degrees for the 35 degree bend).
park lab
spawn lab_hill_twelve
cmd 6 speed 15.5
hold ollie 8..420
hold left 50..59
hold left 80..89
hold left 110..119
hold left 140..149
hold left 170..179
hold left 200..209
hold left 230..239
hold left 260..269
hold left 290..299
hold left 320..329
run 420
expect min skater.steer > -0.7 over 180..330
expect max skater.steer < -0.42 over 180..330
expect skater.pos.x > 78.3 at 330
expect skater.pos.x < 80.3 at 330
expect skater.fwd.x > 0.55 at 420
expect skater.fwd.x < 0.7 at 420
expect no event bail
